    description: "Commons Romana is a boutique coworking space set on a quiet street near Piata Romana and Calea Victoriei, in the heart of Bucharest's Sector 1 business and cultural center. Spread across four floors of a renovated building, the 510 sqm space pairs high ceilings and abundant natural light with a calm, design-led atmosphere.\n\nMembers can choose hot desks, dedicated desks or private offices, all backed by high-speed internet, meeting rooms and quiet phone booths. A fully equipped kitchen, bar area, free coffee, tea and drinking water, and an outdoor terrace make it easy to take a break without leaving the building.\n\nPractical perks round out the offer: 24/7 access, private lockers, on-site cleaning and maintenance, printing, bike parking and a dog-friendly policy. Utilities and building charges are included, so teams and freelancers can settle in and focus on work.\n\nIts central Romana location puts members minutes from metro links, restaurants and Bucharest's main commercial corridors, making it a convenient base for independent professionals and small teams alike.",
