    description: "Hotspot Skyhub is a design-led coworking space on the upper floors of Orhideea Towers in Sector 6, Bucharest, offering panoramic views across the city. Located on Șoseaua Orhideelor near Grozavești metro and about ten minutes from the centre, it pairs comfortable workstations with bright, naturally lit interiors and a nature-inspired lounge with a jungle-style relaxing zone.\n\nThe space was designed in collaboration with Studio Biroarchitetti (Milan), giving it a vibrant, colourful and home-like working environment. Members and teams can choose from bespoke team offices and private suites alongside flexible coworking desks.\n\nMeeting rooms accommodate groups from 4 to 16 people with strong acoustics and ergonomic furniture, while the on-site event space can host gatherings of up to 80 people. State-of-the-art technology infrastructure supports day-to-day work, calls and presentations.\n\nHotspot Skyhub suits remote workers, freelancers and growing teams looking for a professional, well-connected base in western Bucharest with standout views and a creative atmosphere.",
