    description: "Talent Garden Bucharest is a 700-square-meter coworking campus set on the ground floor of the historic Palatul Universul on Strada Ion Brezoianu, in the central Sector 1 of Bucharest. As part of Talent Garden's international network of campuses across Europe, it positions itself as the city's first hub dedicated to the creative and digital industries, hosting freelancers, agencies, startups and established tech companies.\n\nMembers get 24/7 card access to roughly 65 workstations, ranging from hot desks at shared tables to dedicated fixed desks. The space includes meeting rooms, an event area, kitchen facilities, printing and personal lockers, alongside front-desk and mail handling support. Fully furnished and move-in ready, it suits both solo professionals and small teams.\n\nBeyond the desks, the campus runs a community program of workshops, networking events and wellness activities, and members can tap into the wider Talent Garden network of campuses. Its central location near Cismigiu Gardens and Bucharest's old town keeps cafes, restaurants and public transport within easy reach.",
